  <section class="information">
    <h2>Welcome to PortionPrefect</h2>
    <P> This page is dedicated to helping people modify their recipes to allow its users with the flexiablity to adpate their recipes to what they have in there pantry</P>
    <p>To contuine please log in for sign up an account</p>
    <p> At PortionPerfect, we know how frustrating it can be to start cooking and realize you're missing an ingredient or don’t have enough of something. That’s why we created a tool that helps you make the most of what’s already in your kitchen.

    Unlike other recipe converters, PortionPerfect doesn’t just change serving sizes. Our website adjusts recipes based on what you actually have at home. If a recipe calls for two eggs but you only have one, we’ll update the whole recipe for you. We also suggest easy ingredient swaps so you can still cook without running to the store.

    Our goal is simple: help home cooks save time, reduce food waste, and use what they have. PortionPerfect is made to make your life easier—one meal at a time.</p>
